Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:05.01,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You made it past numerous \Nchallenges to stand before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:07.36,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You deserve praise for—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.75,0:00:09.75,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Shh! My friends will hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.75,0:00:13.24,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,H-How dare you?! Do you have any idea who I—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:15.48,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:16.74,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I do know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:20.46,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're a facsimile of\N Magic Queen Sildonia Xarles,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:25.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,who reigned during the ancient magic\Nkingdom's peak, crafted by the queen herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:27.25,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,H-How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.55,0:00:28.88,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:31.26,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Also, we skipped your traps \Nand riddles to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:33.34,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We dug a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:36.51,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to my tomb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:38.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Anyway, can you see to the final trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:40.84,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm pulling out the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.27,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You know about that too? Just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:46.52,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:57.28,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:03.89,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Perfect Reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.09,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:18.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. You read my memories, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:20.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I have the Divine Dragon's Heart too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:22.91,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:26.39,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I knew time travel magic existed, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.61,0:01:28.90,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle, are you over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:31.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Not good! My friends don't\N know about any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:33.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Just follow my lead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:33.83,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.83,0:01:34.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:36.67,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You're a real pain, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.41,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:42.76,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Whoa, a legendary intelligent sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,And your name is Sildonia Xarles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:46.66,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:52.63,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Liese, was it? These treats are quite tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.33,0:01:56.62,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,They're just simple provisions\NI made before we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.07,0:01:59.14,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Say, are you really the magic queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:01.48,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,To be precise, a part of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:07.39,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I am a magic life form created to evaluate \Nwhether you're worthy of my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.39,0:02:09.18,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,And yet you eat treats?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:12.67,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'm converting them into magic \Npower to support myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:13.90,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,They're not going to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:16.34,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Why do you look like a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:20.14,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I froze my growth at the age\N my magic power peaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:22.91,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I looked like this until the day I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:27.29,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,If you weren't worthy of my treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:31.67,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I would've triggered the final trap\N and destroyed the labyrinth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:34.04,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,but you intrigue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.67,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You have my approval for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:38.66,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You may use that sword as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:42.18,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Thanks. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.89,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Take that apport bag as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:48.93,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It connects to the treasure room,\Nso it's convenient for getting treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:51.17,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Hey, I use a sword too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:53.84,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Why not let me use you instead of Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:54.57,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:00.21,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Physiological incompatibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.67,0:03:02.82,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You get rejected for that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:05.45,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Tastes haven't changed in a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:40.57,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Delicious! Just delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You can eat later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:50.26,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Something smells lovely\Nat the stalls over there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:53.29,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You're like a country kid in \Nthe big city for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:55.86,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Where are we going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, we've got our treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So to prepare for our upcoming battles,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,we'll need high-quality gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:05.97,Default,GUIDE,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:07.53,Default,GUIDE,0,0,0,,Have you business at our shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:09.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'd like to purchase equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:14.03,Default,GUIDE,0,0,0,,Pardon, but do you have \Na referral from anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.03,0:05:18.98,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, right. You need deposits from new \Ncustomers before they enter the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:23.05,Default,GUIDE,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we'll ask a deposit\N of ten thousand gadols.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:27.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Is five gold Xarles coins \Nenough for the four of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:30.35,Default,GUIDE,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:32.56,Default,GUIDE,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.67,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Welcome. I am Fesba, the shopkeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:41.92,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Ah, this is Melanis's handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.71,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:47.32,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,He was an extraordinary craftsman \Nof the ancient magic kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.61,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,He wasn't that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:50.21,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:52.48,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,He was rather proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:56.14,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,He'd tear up when I started \Npointing out flaws in his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:56.71,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:58.56,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Please, ignore all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:00.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The kid here's just got a fertile imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:04.71,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Oh, do pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:09.72,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,My, these treats are tasty as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:12.85,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,This here is our shop's flagship product.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.84,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Dragon leather armor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:20.11,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Yes. In addition to the physical \Nand magical protections of dragon hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:23.03,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,we've added heat, cold, and poison resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:28.56,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,The lining is made of phoenix feathers, \Nso you can imagine the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:30.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:32.08,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,What? O-Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:33.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What about you, Theron?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:36.59,Default,THRON,0,0,0,,We'd be matching. Hard pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:40.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We're getting our equipment here, \Nso pick out everything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:42.11,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:43.63,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What should I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:50.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's lighter and easier to move in\N than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:52.89,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah. These gauntlets seem nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:56.26,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,A spirit stone amulet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:57.89,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,This is my first time wearing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:02.14,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Got any swords that'll make \Nthe babes swoon over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.99,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Especially babes like you—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:05.40,Default,FEMALE EMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,I'll bring one right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:07.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Can I see your magic stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.65,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.23,0:07:14.95,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,For offense, how about these\N enchanted with Explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:17.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sounds useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:21.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Do you have anything highly effective \Nagainst reptilian monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:23.67,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,But of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.35,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,A Blizzard stone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:33.18,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Yes. Enchanting stones with cold spells\N is tricky, so they're fairly expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.01,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We'll take all you've got of both.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:36.68,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Every single one, sir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:39.43,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If you've got healing potions,\Nwe'll take all of those too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:41.88,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,{\i1}All{\i0} of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:46.44,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It would be a hefty load in coins,\Nso may I pay with gems as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:49.07,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That should be about ten million gadols.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.07,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Ten million gadols?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:54.82,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.73,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,We look forward to your next visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:00.68,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Man, that was quite a shopping spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.71,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I hope no one spreads any nasty rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:04.28,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We'll be leaving tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:07.19,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,We're only here for a night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:09.09,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Then I've got no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:11.32,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I think I'll take a look around too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:13.11,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,It's not often I'm in the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:14.53,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I'll show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:16.00,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.60,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Really? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:19.38,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:21.08,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.91,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Those two have gotten close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:26.63,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I feel kind of conflicted about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.26,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Then I shall be off as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:29.75,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I spy tasty stalls over—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:33.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Wait. There's something I \Nwant to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,While the others aren't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:38.48,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,First, I'd like to confirm something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:45.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Is it truly possible to change the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.99,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,That's an odd way to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:52.38,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The future, by definition, \Nis not set in stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.13,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:59.34,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,When you traveled back in time,\Nyou simultaneously came to a new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:01.41,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,This is just my theory,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:03.43,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,but there isn't a single timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.43,0:09:06.37,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Time splits into numerous\Nlines like tree branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.37,0:09:10.40,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,And your soul jumped \Nfrom one branch to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:14.78,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,As evidence of this, the Divine \NDragon's Heart you used as a catalyst
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:17.91,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,was also transported here alongside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:22.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Then if this is a new world, it won't \Nnecessarily follow the same history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:25.61,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Not identically, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:28.57,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Although the broad strokes will be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:32.47,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Great Invasion \Nwill almost certainly occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:34.92,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:39.30,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Naturally, that's only if you or I do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:43.56,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It should be possible for us to forge a new \Nhistory through our actions and involvement,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:45.94,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,though it will probably prove difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:47.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:49.77,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:51.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:55.64,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,There are two Divine Dragon's Hearts\N in this world now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.20,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But only one of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.63,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Yes, I have a theory about that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.63,0:10:05.45,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The most forbidden of magics is a \Nfusion spell that is never to be named.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:07.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Fusion spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.21,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What is that? I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:15.23,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Simply put, it's a way to increase \None's magic power by fusing souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Increase your magic power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:21.50,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Your magic power is determined \Nat birth by the constitution of your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:26.48,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,In ancient Xarles, we researched \Nways to strengthen souls themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:31.91,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,This can be done by fusing them,\Nbut there are many problems with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:33.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Did you fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:40.73,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Indeed. We tried using the souls of infants \Nand experimented with artificial souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:44.80,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Thinking back on it, we feared nothing. \NNot even the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:47.00,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,But I digress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:50.90,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,There are now two Divine Dragon's Hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:55.75,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,So what do you think happened to the soul \Nof the Kyle Leonard in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.21,0:10:59.01,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What happened to it? You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.36,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,That's right. It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:09.23,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The soul fusing I mentioned happened \Nto you without you realizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:13.92,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Your soul should have been strengthened \Nand your magic power doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:15.77,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Does that ring any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:17.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:26.45,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It's possible you'll be able to use \Nthe highest level of spells in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:30.40,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Me, use the highest spells there are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.71,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It's just a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:37.06,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Whether or not you can master \Nthem is another matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:39.21,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,and all the effects won't \Nnecessarily be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:41.69,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Will there be negative effects?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:46.22,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Who knows? This is unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:50.66,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,So if you notice anything unusual,\Ndon't hesitate to mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.79,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'll gladly give you advice again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:57.52,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Thanks. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:12.96,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I've gotten used to camping out,\N but beds sure are nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:14.71,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:21.24,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You're not going to bed yet, Urza?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:27.72,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,No. Every month, I look forward to bathing \Nin the light of the full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:31.12,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,All right. In that case, I'm turning in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.60,0:12:34.73,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.62,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yeah, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.21,0:12:46.99,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure how it would go at first, \Nbut this trip hasn't been so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:49.43,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,Liese is a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:50.95,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,We get along well too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:55.60,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,Sildonia has such vast knowledge, so always \Nhas something interesting to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.11,0:12:59.56,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,Theron is... well, he's fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.39,0:13:02.51,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,And then there's Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.99,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,He's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:09.61,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,He looks at me like he sees right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:13.74,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,Yet for some reason, \Nthat doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.52,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:23.80,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I'm the only one... allowed at Kyle's side...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.03,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Talking in her sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:36.61,Main - Italics,URZA,0,0,0,,O great Goddess Muna, bless this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:48.80,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Wait, I totally forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:58.81,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,My stamina has improved some,\Nbut I still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:02.15,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The Phantom Training Method?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.82,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,We didn't have that in my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:08.32,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It doesn't compare to actual battle, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:11.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,This is truly an amazing sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:14.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It feels like an extension of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:15.98,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Of course it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:18.98,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I am the embodiment of \NXarles's magic technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:22.34,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,There is no greater blade \Nforged by humanoid hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:26.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I've used mithril swords before, \Nbut none compared to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:30.96,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,To be precise, that's not made of mithril.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:32.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:33.87,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:38.35,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I... I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What's going on? It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.46,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,The Application of the Contract!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:44.36,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We can only do it now during the full moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:46.48,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:48.24,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You're the one who suggested it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:53.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Let's do it another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.37,0:14:55.67,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,That would be a month from now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.62,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,My true name is at stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:01.25,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:03.17,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You don't have to sound so bothered!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:11.89,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,Normally, in an Application of the Contract, \Nwe would offer each other our true names
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:15.24,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,and swear to remain together for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.29,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,They're performed at marriage ceremonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:21.76,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,When I first heard about it, my heart fluttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:24.98,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,Yet now things have wound up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:28.38,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,I never dreamed of doing this with\Na man I've only known half a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:32.36,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I'm ready. Stand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:36.62,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Don't fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:38.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.49,0:15:40.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I thought this would be simpler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:43.38,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Just stand there. Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:47.63,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I will now perform the\NApplication of the Contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:58.14,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,From here, it'll be just like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:10.86,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,In the name of the great moon deity Muna,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:14.74,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I, Urza Eksess, command you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.97,0:16:17.74,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I forbid you from sharing \Nmy true name or using it for evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:18.94,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Do you swear to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:19.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:37.17,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:36.64,Main - Top,KYLE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:39.14,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:42.07,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I thought we sealed the contract with a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.07,0:16:42.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Was I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:45.87,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,That's like a bonus you \Ndo at wedding ceremonies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.87,0:16:48.40,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,The contract is complete \Nonce you swear to its terms!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:52.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, really? In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:55.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I guess this was an unfortunate accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:59.06,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Since we've already got a magic circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.91,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I shall also perform a contract \Nwith a salamander fire spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:03.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:08.17,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,My first command is to scorch \Nthe sexual offender before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:10.21,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:23.43,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Why are you three so sleepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:26.56,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,There was an unfortunate incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:29.22,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Shut up. Don't speak of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:31.60,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle, you smell burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:34.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That was an unfortunate \Nmisunderstanding as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:36.70,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I mean, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:40.04,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,By the way, we've done \Nthe Application of the Contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:43.08,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,but can I assume you'll \Ncontinue to travel with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:44.95,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:50.17,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I still haven't heard how or why\N you know my true name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:53.09,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I can't let you out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:54.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds like you have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:17:59.40,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm sleepy because—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:03.31,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I'm sure you were up late hitting \Non women and getting shot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.31,0:18:05.67,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Not just up late! I was at it all night long!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:08.40,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,City women being easier is a total lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:11.86,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Ignore him. Why are we going to Archen next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:18.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, because... Sildonia apparently \Nhas a bit of a prophetic ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:19.11,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:23.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,According to the reading, \Nwe should head to Archen next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:26.93,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,A-Ah, yes, indeed. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:30.37,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I do possess such an ability. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.21,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Really? That reaction seems odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:33.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Just your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:43.14,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,This is quite a crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:47.07,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Apparently, Princess Milena is \Ncoming to express her condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:48.89,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:51.06,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Then we got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:53.40,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,This is my first time seeing her as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.89,0:19:00.41,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:11.92,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Princess Milena de Zirgus, \NZirgus's pride and joy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.45,0:19:14.38,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,She's the future queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.10,0:19:17.05,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,She's as pretty as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:18.92,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.04,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:30.62,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Are you unhurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:32.31,Default,NINOS,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:35.73,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,What pretty flowers. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.85,0:19:41.77,Default,TOWNSFOLK A,0,0,0,,She's so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.77,0:19:45.28,Default,TOWNSFOLK B,0,0,0,,I heard she made time in her \Nbusy schedule for this visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:47.58,Default,TOWNSFOLK C,0,0,0,,What a wonderful princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:52.98,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Zentos...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:08.18,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Kyle, are you certain it's this princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:12.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. Princess Milena is sixteen years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:15.94,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,She's destined to die two days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:28.55,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Two days from now, in the early morning, \Nwhile heading from Archen to Sanes Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.55,0:20:30.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,the princess's caravan gets\N attacked by a hydra.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:35.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The forests near Archen have always \Nbeen infested with monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:39.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,and Sanes Village was attacked \Nby a hydra a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:43.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The princess has come to Archen \Nupon learning of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:47.15,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,And next, she'll head to the \Nstill dangerous Sanes Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.15,0:20:49.56,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,only to be cut down on the way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.55,0:20:54.69,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,People will say it's a tragedy \Ncaused by her goodwill and bad luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:21:00.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,but if you ask me, it's the natural\N outcome of her reckless actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:03.70,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,There was no funny business \Nbehind it, was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:08.70,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Like an assassination made to look\N like the work of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:13.48,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, following the princess's death,\N there were all kinds of rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:19.15,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The most suspicion was cast upon \Nthe princess's half-brother, Prince Carenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:22.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,As a concubine's child, \Nhe's second in line for the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:25.72,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He benefits the most from her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:31.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,And even more suspiciously, \NPrince Carenas is in town right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:35.73,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Oh? But no one's talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:39.20,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He's a shut-in and won't make\N public appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:41.66,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,How very suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.97,0:21:47.50,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, I said there were rumors, but in the end,\N it was deemed an unfortunate accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:52.93,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,And now you're trying to use \Nthat unfortunate accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:58.23,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll gallantly show up to save\NZirgus's pride and joy when she's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:03.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It'll make the perfect start\N to my heroic tale.
